sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as authMiddleware
    participant L as checkExpenseLimit
    participant Ctrl as Controller
    participant Svc as Service / Prisma
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant EH as errorHandler

    C->>A: POST /api/expenses (JWT)
    A->>A: verify JWT, confirm session
    alt invalid or expired token
        A-->>C: 401 Unauthorized
    end
    A->>L: next()
    L->>DB: sum spend for day/week/month scope
    alt would exceed configured limit
        L-->>C: 400 alert with exceeded scopes
    end
    L->>Ctrl: next()
    Ctrl->>Ctrl: throw ApiError on validation failure
    Ctrl->>Svc: business logic
    Svc->>DB: write, transaction-wrapped where balances change
    DB-->>Svc: result
    Svc-->>Ctrl: result
    Ctrl-->>C: 200 or 201 JSON
    Ctrl->>EH: thrown ApiError forwarded via next(err)
    EH-->>C: message and details with correct status code
